  "description": "Tackle HD began as a group of like-minded fishermen who met on the Ozark Anglers fishing forum. We saw a need in the market for a company who could produce realistic baits that had the natural, fish catching action that most realistic baits just don’t have. \r\n\r\nOur flagship product, the Hi-Def Craw, was produced using the latest technology 3D laser scanner. The laser scanner captures every minute detail down to .001” accuracy. We’ve tested, refined, and re-tested, to produce what we believe is a bait that is almost like a live crawfish in movement and appearance.\r\n\r\nOur mission is to continue engineering the most realistic, Hi-Def baits on the market. We have built the company from our incredible start with the Craw and continue to grow. The company was purchased by River's Edge Products in late 2019 and they help us grow more and more everyday.\r\n\r\nWe have expanded our fishing line from just the Hi-Def Craw to now include Hellgrammites, Swimmers, and Buzz Baits. We have plans in the works to expand this line even more to be the best line of baits you can find. As we work with new partners and ideas to expand our line and knowledge; Check with us constantly for new and exciting updates. You can find us on YouTube, Facebook, and Instagram!\r\n\r\nThank you for your support!",
